WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:24.333
I'm lonely. I'm bored.

2
00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.988
And I'm really sad.

3
00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:29.502
I'm stuck in my room.

4
00:00:29.503 --> 00:00:33.803
And I'm getting mad.

5
00:00:33.804 --> 00:00:39.665
My friends are playing.

6
00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:42.951
And I'm in my bed.

7
00:00:42.952 --> 00:00:48.396
I can't play outside with this broken leg!

8
00:00:48.397 --> 00:01:01.888
If I had wings, I would fly high in the sky.

9
00:01:01.889 --> 00:01:04.595
I would fly to the birds.

10
00:01:04.596 --> 00:01:08.947
I'd even say, "Hi!"

11
00:01:08.948 --> 00:01:18.829
If I had fins, I would swim deep in the sea.

12
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:25.357
I would look for treasure.

13
00:01:25.358 --> 00:01:30.336
It would be all for me.

14
00:01:30.337 --> 00:01:40.996
If I had a horse, I would run through the mountains.

15
00:01:40.997 --> 00:01:46.728
I would stop for water.

16
00:01:46.729 --> 00:01:53.479
I'd drink from the fountains.

17
00:01:53.480 --> 00:02:01.242
If I had a sailboat, I would sail on the water.

18
00:02:01.243 --> 00:02:12.404
I would see dolphins and whales.

19
00:02:12.405 --> 00:02:20.602
I'd even see otters.

20
00:02:20.603 --> 00:02:27.928
If I had an airplane, I would fly to faraway lands.

21
00:02:27.929 --> 00:02:32.280
I would stop in the desert.

22
00:02:32.281 --> 00:02:42.063
I'd see a huge cactus in the sand.

23
00:02:42.064 --> 00:02:44.873
But I don't have wings.

24
00:02:44.874 --> 00:02:48.590
I have none of these things.

25
00:02:48.591 --> 00:02:51.463
I have one broken leg.

26
00:02:51.464 --> 00:02:56.111
It's stuck in a sling.

27
00:02:56.112 --> 00:03:01.270
Wait! There's a knock at my door.

28
00:03:01.271 --> 00:03:13.640
One friend, two friends, three friends, four!
